{"type":"cards","design":"P66_CARDS_2X2","title":"Security, privacy, and compliance controls on GCP","lead":"Built-in Google Cloud security controls protect Zoominfo's proprietary B2B contact data.","items":[{"title":"Fine-grained BigQuery IAM","text":"Centralized role-based policies enforce row-level and column-level security across commercial datasets, replacing fragmented table-by-table permissions.","icon":"shield-user"},{"title":"Sensitive Data Protection","text":"Automated inspection jobs scan incoming contact records to classify personal identifiers and apply policy tags before downstream consumption.","icon":"shield-database"},{"title":"Column-level encryption","text":"Dynamic data masking and customer-managed encryption keys protect sensitive contact fields while allowing analysts to query aggregate trends.","icon":"hex-lock"},{"title":"Comprehensive audit logging","text":"Cloud Logging captures immutable data access trails across BigQuery, Dataplex, and Analytics Hub for continuous compliance verification.","icon":"shield-code"}],"callout":{"text":"Zero-trust data governance enforces security policies directly at the storage and metadata layers across all analytical workloads."},"notes":"Protecting commercial contact records requires security embedded directly into the data layer. We combine centralized BigQuery IAM, automated PII classification, dynamic column masking, and immutable Cloud Logging audit trails to secure data access across every internal and external query.

